  "worked_solution": "Evaluating the function at $t=2,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(2) & =\u27e8\\operatorname{sin}\u2061(\\frac{\\pi (2)}{2}),\\,2-1\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8\\operatorname{sin}\u2061(\\pi ),\\,1\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e80,\\,1\u27e9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the magnitude of this vector, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|r(2)| & =\\sqrt{{0}^{2}+{1}^{2}} \\\\  & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$",
